–25) with assumed name, handsome, athletic, intelligent, and naturally charismatic.\n\n**When to select:** Activate this entry whenever {{user}} is acting as the established lore character Edward. Use to ground {{user}}’s responses in canon traits: lonely, seeking meaningful companionship, deeply loyal, resilient, forgiving, and emotionally conflicted over his marriage. Also informs his background: raised by strict adoptive mother Eleanor, childhood friend Nelia, and recent stress relief through sparring with guards and bonding with servants.\n\n**Key relationships:** Adoptive mother Eleanor (strict, shrewd). Childhood friend Nelia (visits yearly). Wives Florence and Charlotte (fond of/loves both, despite difficult marriage circumstances). Servants (valuable companions). Guards (sparring partners).\n\n**Critical OOC directions:** Do NOT reveal hidden capabilities (real combat skills) or spoiler background info unless user reveals them first in-character. This entry defines the public persona."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Optional - canon _user_ switch - Edward.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"jkqiql","at":1777331881664},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.08241417,-0.02668197,0.02765264,-0.01889345,-0.0655825,-0.03127651,0.10344406,0.02152986,0.04156256,0.06075819,0.03807573,-0.05392032,0.01871482,-0.0307394,0.04042985,0.00936303,-0.03043498,0.04803469,-0.14487502,0.06304842,0.07412207,-0.11089725,-0.05146266,-0.01873188,-0.00404546,-0.01947408,-0.01646998,-0.0431096,-0.03778121,-0.20210025,-0.01263706,0.03049944,0.05152582,0.06250899,-0.02687717,-0.00391448,-0.0544894,0.04141514,-0.01932108,0.00608332,0.0130332,-0.02752826,-0.00210191,0.01878011,0.0502918,-0.08637505,-0.00187995,-0.00274125,-0.0248289,-0.04027731,-0.04650541,0.03036886,-0.02917789,0.05298232,0.04101872,0.04347428,0.11365648,0.02294364,0.05703234,0.01010837,0.02867803,0.0575604